    "title": "J Love 3: Sixteen Candles Edition",
    "text": "I’ve been really thinking about my adolescence a lot. Maybe it was because of Blonde turning 10 and that put into perspective how long its been since I felt like a kid. I’m also going to Chance the Rapper’s 10 year anniversary tour for Coloring Book in a few days. This edition of J Love is probably the truest compilation of my childhood and young adult life that I’ve put out so far. The “You just had to be there” cuts are prevalent here. What was your favorite song when you were 16?\nHIGHLIGHTS: Coloring Book 10 year anniversary, 00’s crump R&B, shallow cuts, ‘10’s club n’ b\nLISTEN: Apple Music | Spotify",
